# Certificate modules: the class data and the vm_compute checks of the
# link descent (docs/roadmap.md §68-§73). Built by `make certs`, not by
# `make coq`: they need tens of CPU-hours, more than CI can give, and
# no theory module imports them. `make certs-coqchk` re-checks each
# with coqchk; `make certs-assumptions` and `make certs-statements`
# audit the theorems listed in tools/audited_certs.txt.
#
# Link23s*, Link22s*, Link21s* and their combining modules carry the
# census chain: every certificate is checked by LPCert.check through
# Link23.lpclass (§73). LinkCerts* are §64's LP certificates for sizes
# 23-27, checked by LinkLP.certcheck: an independent cross-check by a
# different model and checker, on which no census theorem depends.
-Q coq Sunflower
-arg -w -arg -notation-overridden,-deprecated-syntactic-definition,-deprecated-hint-without-locality
